#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.1.rst:83
msgid ""
"Only WiFi scripts are affected: port WINC code to the standard "
":class:`network.WLAN` interface and fix the NINA ``ifconfig()`` argument "
"order (:ref:`the WiFi API change <v4_1_1_wifi>`). All other scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Alleen WiFi-scripts worden getroffen: port WINC-code naar de standaard "
":class:`network.WLAN`\\ -interface en corrigeer de argumentvolgorde van NINA"
" ``ifconfig()`` (\\ :ref:`de WiFi-API-wijziging <v4_1_1_wifi>`\\ ). Alle "
"overige scripts draaien ongewijzigd."
